==English==
{{number box|en|10}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|tenfold}}, {{m|enm|tenfolde}}, from {{inh|en|ang|tīenfeald}}. Equivalent to {{suffix|en|ten|fold}}.

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# [[ten|Ten]] times as much or as many.
#* {{RQ:Thomson Spring|lines=923–925|page=198|passage=[F]ull of death, and fierce vvith '''tenfold''' froſt, / The long long night, incumbent o'er their heads, / Falls horrible.}}
# Containing [[ten]] parts.

